all; Piper has no Kannada voice) — see docs/architecture.md "Voice &
language (Module 12)" for the full reasoning per capability, plus the
transformers-version-pin and IndicTransToolkit-without-a-compiler
workarounds that were needed to get IndicTrans2/vits_rasa_13 running at
all on this machine.

